+//! Reader for the merchant statement text format.
+//!
+//! The input is unquoted, comma separated UTF-8 text. Two record shapes are
+//! supported:
+//!
+//! * `deposit,请求ID,账户,金额`
+//! * `transfer,请求ID,源账户,目标账户,金额`
+//!
+//! Every field is trimmed; blank lines and whole lines that start (after
+//! trimming) with `#` are ignored. Headers, inline comments and extra columns
+//! are not supported. Errors are prefixed with `第 N 行：`, where `N` is the
+//! 1-based physical line number in the original input.
+
